{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>What's in the Demo?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This Demo has three maps, each with a unique gamemode.\u00a0<strong>The full game will have more maps,  cosmetics, and other features.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051340/extras/693ad4feeead406a4d20439b3b84542a.poster.avif?t=1759980998\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051340/extras/693ad4feeead406a4d20439b3b84542a.webm?t=1759980998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051340/extras/693ad4feeead406a4d20439b3b84542a.mp4?t=1759980998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Catto Pew Pew! is a physics-based shooter game where competitive gameplay, proximity chat, and pure chaos collide. Shoot your opponents into the sky and claim your victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051340/extras/c9999c2acfb172d1eaa850f4871ad0db.poster.avif?t=1759980998\" width=620 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051340/extras/c9999c2acfb172d1eaa850f4871ad0db.webm?t=1759980998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051340/extras/c9999c2acfb172d1eaa850f4871ad0db.mp4?t=1759980998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play your way\u2014whether you're in VR or on PC, cross-platform multiplayer keeps the chaos going. Dive into the mayhem with friends, no matter the device... it's one big party!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051340/extras/821a53d0f126ce15ef037a6797650728.poster.avif?t=1759980998\" width=620 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051340/extras/821a53d0f126ce15ef037a6797650728.webm?t=1759980998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051340/extras/821a53d0f126ce15ef037a6797650728.mp4?t=1759980998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Outplay, outlast, and outrank the competition as you fight your way to the top. Win matches and rack up trophies to climb the ranks and become the ultimate Catto Competitor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i> </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051340/extras/b5278c212886fb674936e8e3ab25b3fe.poster.avif?t=1759980998\" width=620 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051340/extras/b5278c212886fb674936e8e3ab25b3fe.webm?t=1759980998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051340/extras/b5278c212886fb674936e8e3ab25b3fe.mp4?t=1759980998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"te